Medicine Woman returns, she says she cannot continue the ceremony.
I feel that something is not in harmony with me and that is why she has
stopped.
At the time I had this dream, my husband of eleven years and I had just di-
vorced. Even though we had both agreed that the marriage was over, the separa-
tion precipitated a deep descent for me. So it was no wonder that my husband in
the dream was the vehicle for my journey to the underworld.
